Subject: [PATCH] AltVivo SSO with paid-entitlement gate; container image;
 Django 5.2 LTS

- lab/altvivo_sso_middleware.py: verifies the .altvivo.bio RS256 cookie via JWKS,
  checks entitlements.xprism.active (SUPERADMIN / ADVISORY_BOARD bypass), Redis
  revocation, syncs lab.User (new altvivo_sub field), injects <altvivo-topbar>
- unauthenticated -> altvivo.bio/login?redirect=, unpaid -> /workspace/upgrade?app=xprism
- local login/sign-up/password pages hand off to AltVivo; logout ends the central session
- Resend inbound webhook and /healthz stay outside the gate
- Dockerfile: python:3.12-slim, Gunicorn, WhiteNoise; Django 5.1 (EOL) -> 5.2 LTS
- lab/tests_altvivo.py (12 tests, run with ALTVIVO_JWKS_URL set)
